{"2600960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HoverGrease 2", "steam_appid": 2600960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4562230, 4569920], "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/efde9aa1979714ae522c9079d7b743ca.avif?t=1780747551\" width=1496 height=824 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH THE MUTANT WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant, bio-cyberpunk world of Diamond Core Metropolis, where chaos reigns in every arena. Take control of a powerful mutant, master unique abilities, and fight for survival in an electrifying dystopian future. <br><br>Embark on the 14 chapters of the <strong>Singleplayer Story Mode</strong> or dominate the thrilling <strong>5v5 Online Multiplayer</strong> modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2ae295677bb35c37a42bde030abf0db0.poster.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2ae295677bb35c37a42bde030abf0db0.webm?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2ae295677bb35c37a42bde030abf0db0.mp4?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BIO-CYBERPUNK WORLD OF HOVERGREASE 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of HoverGrease is a bio-cyberpunk dystopian future Earth, where mankind has unlocked many of the secrets of the human genome.  It’s a place over-saturated with AI, cybernetic enhancements, and biotechnology. Mutations are rare, but not uncommon.<br><br>Fight in the Downtown streets of Pine Bay, blast your enemies off the platforms of the Skyrise District, and survive the waves of attacks from the shores of Razer beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/e78c979983498a03f214da31680806ec.poster.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/e78c979983498a03f214da31680806ec.webm?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/e78c979983498a03f214da31680806ec.mp4?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE MUTANT FOR YOUR PLAY STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from <strong>10 mutants</strong> with over <strong>180 weapons and attacks</strong>, and blast your way to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/0313e56d565293e492117ac13e2791a6.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Kimmy Frog for rockets, Madeye Bull or Piggy for melee dash-and-slash, snipe your enemy with Scarlet and Billy Bo, or support the team with Labrat Perry and Peanut Piper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/3ed1416e259e0a3558acb495de7b28db.poster.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/3ed1416e259e0a3558acb495de7b28db.webm?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/3ed1416e259e0a3558acb495de7b28db.mp4?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY TO PICK UP, HARD TO MASTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoverGrease 2 is incredibly easy to pick up.<br><br>Despite its top-down perspective widely associated with MOBAs, HoverGrease 2 plays more like a shooter (WASD+mouse or twin-stick gamepad). Skills are more important than ‘builds’, but strategy and teamwork trump both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER STORY &amp; MULTIPLAYER GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of HoverGrease 2 and play the <i>story mode</i>. Then join your friends online in a <i>team-based multiplayer online</i> game that will challenge your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer story of 14 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique mutants to pick from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >180 unique weapons/attacks (18 for each mutant)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps for multiplayer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special arcade 1v1 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Pass for online gamemodes and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins, achievement awards and in-game badges (cosmetics only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win, all heroes and weapons available when you buy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way! Mouse &amp; Keyboard, Gamepad, or  Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f99316961c3079f0570915e6d930b13f.avif?t=1780747551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras_big/f99316961c3079f0570915e6d930b13f.avif?t=1780747551 width=800 height=638 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH THE MUTANT WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant, bio-cyberpunk world of Diamond Core Metropolis, where chaos reigns in every arena. Take control of a powerful mutant, master unique abilities, and fight for survival in an electrifying dystopian future. <br><br>Embark on the 14 chapters of the <strong>Singleplayer Story Mode</strong> or dominate the thrilling <strong>5v5 Online Multiplayer</strong> modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2ae295677bb35c37a42bde030abf0db0.poster.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2ae295677bb35c37a42bde030abf0db0.webm?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/2ae295677bb35c37a42bde030abf0db0.mp4?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BIO-CYBERPUNK WORLD OF HOVERGREASE 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of HoverGrease is a bio-cyberpunk dystopian future Earth, where mankind has unlocked many of the secrets of the human genome.  It’s a place over-saturated with AI, cybernetic enhancements, and biotechnology. Mutations are rare, but not uncommon.<br><br>Fight in the Downtown streets of Pine Bay, blast your enemies off the platforms of the Skyrise District, and survive the waves of attacks from the shores of Razer beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/e78c979983498a03f214da31680806ec.poster.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/e78c979983498a03f214da31680806ec.webm?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/e78c979983498a03f214da31680806ec.mp4?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE MUTANT FOR YOUR PLAY STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from <strong>10 mutants</strong> with over <strong>180 weapons and attacks</strong>, and blast your way to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/0313e56d565293e492117ac13e2791a6.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Kimmy Frog for rockets, Madeye Bull or Piggy for melee dash-and-slash, snipe your enemy with Scarlet and Billy Bo, or support the team with Labrat Perry and Peanut Piper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/3ed1416e259e0a3558acb495de7b28db.poster.avif?t=1780747551\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/3ed1416e259e0a3558acb495de7b28db.webm?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/3ed1416e259e0a3558acb495de7b28db.mp4?t=1780747551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY TO PICK UP, HARD TO MASTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoverGrease 2 is incredibly easy to pick up.<br><br>Despite its top-down perspective widely associated with MOBAs, HoverGrease 2 plays more like a shooter (WASD+mouse or twin-stick gamepad). Skills are more important than ‘builds’, but strategy and teamwork trump both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER STORY &amp; MULTIPLAYER GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of HoverGrease 2 and play the <i>story mode</i>. Then join your friends online in a <i>team-based multiplayer online</i> game that will challenge your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer story of 14 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique mutants to pick from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >180 unique weapons/attacks (18 for each mutant)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps for multiplayer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special arcade 1v1 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Pass for online gamemodes and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins, achievement awards and in-game badges (cosmetics only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win, all heroes and weapons available when you buy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way! Mouse &amp; Keyboard, Gamepad, or  Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras/f99316961c3079f0570915e6d930b13f.avif?t=1780747551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/extras_big/f99316961c3079f0570915e6d930b13f.avif?t=1780747551 width=800 height=638 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "TOP-DOWN SHOOTER x HERO SHOOTER. Mixing the traditional elements of a team-based game with the arcade thrill of a twin-stick shooter. A super fast-paced game, where both your reflexes and your team’s positioning play a crucial role. Play the Singleplayer Story or join the 5v5 Online Multiplayer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/8eda120ea55d9cacc579664502e1aefff4e31868/header.jpg?t=1780747551", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/9f981d6e86f6fe6844f8502c66ecce155494926b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780747551", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600960/9f981d6e86f6fe6844f8502c66ecce155494926b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780747551", "website": "https://hovergrease.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit (latest Service Pack)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3 or AMD Phenom™ X3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 / GTX 1650 or AMD R9 380/AMD RX 6400 or Intel® Arc™ A770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 11 64-bit (latest Service Pack)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen™ 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1070 / RTX 2060 or AMD RX 580 / RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements